# Stalactite Stalker: "At the beginning of your end step, if you descended this turn, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature" (CR 700.11).
# On turn 1 Bot1's Faithless Looting discards the permanent card Ornithopter (and a Plains), so Bot1 descended and the Stalker becomes
# a 2/2 at the end step. "{2}{B}, Sacrifice this creature: Target creature gets -X/-X until end of turn, where X is this creature's
# power": the sacrifice is a cost, so X is the power it last had (2, counter included, CR 113.7a): Bot2's 0/2 Ornithopter dies, which
# -1/-1 would not do.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Stalactite Stalker
Faithless Looting
Ornithopter
Plains
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Stalactite Stalker.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter; Plains)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Stalactite Stalker.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Stalactite Stalker.Power = 2
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Stalactite Stalker.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Stalactite Stalker = (absent)
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 1
